{"id":"p1m5","name":"Rows per file","lang":"pyspark","entry":"solve","params":["spark","input_dir"],"limit_s":30,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p><code>input_dir</code> is the path of a folder that contains CSV files with a header line. Every file has the same columns.</p>\n<p>Return one row per file with <code>file_name</code> (the file name only, without the folder, for example <code>\"day_01.csv\"</code>) and <code>n_rows</code> (the number of data rows, header excluded). Files with no data row are not returned. Sort by <code>file_name</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/day_01.csv</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">id,v\n1,a\n2,b\n</pre><p class=\"exf\"><code>input_dir/day_02.csv</code></p><pre class=\"exv\">id,v\n3,c\n</pre><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>file_name</th><th>n_rows</th></tr><tr><td>day_01.csv</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>day_02.csv</td><td>1</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 30 seconds (pyspark)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 2 GB</div>","starter":"from pyspark.sql import SparkSession, DataFrame, functions as F\n\n\ndef solve(spark: SparkSession, input_dir: str) -> DataFrame:\n    df = spark.read.option(\"header\", True).csv(input_dir)\n    # write your code here\n    return df\n","hints":["Chaque ligne lue connaît son fichier : F.col(\"_metadata.file_name\") (ou F.input_file_name() qui donne le chemin complet).","Ensuite c'est un groupBy(\"file_name\").agg(F.count(\"*\")...)."],"summary_fr":"Lis tous les CSV du dossier (avec en-tête) et renvoie le nom de chaque fichier avec son nombre de lignes de données, trié par nom de fichier.","tags":["lire un dossier","_metadata.file_name"],"minutes":5,"source":"Kata Lab","files":{"root":"input_dir","files":{"day_01.csv":"id,v\n1,a\n2,b\n","day_02.csv":"id,v\n3,c\n"}},"visible":[{"input":{"input_dir":{"__dir__":{"day_01.csv":"id,v\n1,a\n2,b\n","day_02.csv":"id,v\n3,c\n"}}},"expected":{"columns":["file_name","n_rows"],"rows":[["day_01.csv",2],["day_02.csv",1]]}},{"input":{"input_dir":{"__dir__":{"b.csv":"x\n1\n2\n3\n","a.csv":"x\n9\n","c.csv":"x\n"}}},"expected":{"columns":["file_name","n_rows"],"rows":[["a.csv",1],["b.csv",3]]}}],"hidden_n":3,"hidden":"","solution":""}